# Allow-list: BuildKit reads this file for infra/docker/Dockerfile (Phase 1 §11).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!experiment/
# Later lines win. Nothing the container runs reads experiment/results/ (laptop writers only), and a results-only
# commit must not change the image (Phase 1.5 decision 7).
experiment/results/
!README.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
